# OpenWrt 25.x conventions

## Package manager

ImmortalWrt **25.x** uses **`apk`**. Output is `.apk`. Do not write `opkg` / `.ipk` in recipes, docs, or QA.

```sh
apk update
apk add luci-app-snort3
apk info luci-app-snort3
apk del luci-app-snort3
```

CI / Pages: ImmortalWrt **25.12**, `aarch64_generic`.

## LuCI RPC

New backends are **ucode** via **`rpcd-mod-ucode`**, not shell/Lua under `/usr/libexec/rpcd/`.

Install path: `/usr/share/rpcd/ucode/luci.<app>.uc`

Use **`ucode-mod-uci`** and **`ucode-mod-fs`**. Rule **`rpcd-ucode-strict`**. Skill **`openwrt-25x`**.

## Verify ucode

Host hook: `.cursor/hooks.json` → `ucode -c` when `ucode` is on `PATH`.

On the router (macOS has no ucode): `ucode -c /tmp/file.uc` (exit 0), then copy to `/usr/share/rpcd/ucode/` and `/etc/init.d/rpcd restart`.

## Kernel (not this repo)

OpenWrt 25.x default is Linux **6.12**. This feed does not set `KERNEL_PATCHVER`. CM5 ImmortalWrt **rockchip** stays **6.18** — do not “fix” it to 6.12.
